hbmzz.monitor.desc=Right-click to open the DFC terminal.
hbmzz.monitor.desc2=Drag the corner, scroll, or double-click the title to resize. R resets.
hbmzz.monitor.desc3=The front panel shows the whole dashboard; just look at it.
hbmzz.monitor.desc4=The button at the bottom of the left column sets the panel size (up to 4x3).
hbmzz.monitor.desc5=Panel Studio (below it) defines page 4: controls, layout and alarm logic.

